      {
        "Id": "efdba1446636436fb580ba113fad58dc",
        "Title": "INSTRUCTIONS\r\n________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nBy selecting SampleLines in drawing the scripts create section data in separate csv files for each section by SampleLine name + Surface source + station\r\n\r\nBlock selection with more than just the sample lines is accepted, the script filters the proper objects by handle.\r\n\r\nAls the sample line locations are reported in 'well known text' format",
